{
  "description": "M5 mesh import: a house read from meshes/house.obj (box body + gable roof, 7 faces incl. two pentagons) next to a cylinder, under a point lamp; render with 'castplane render examples/mesh_demo.json -o out' (the path is relative to this file)",
